WEBVTT

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:18.000
Another beautiful day!

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:24.150
All right! I gotta make breakfast!

00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:27.450
I'm back.

00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:30.930
This morning, we're having grilled horse mackerel with...

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:35.350
Welcome home, Kana-chan. You're back early!

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:38.380
Yeah, I guess I've gotten used to the route.

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:43.690
But isn't it your day off today?

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:45.690
You're up so early.

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:48.820
I guess so, huh.

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:51.400
It's done!

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:57.870
Those cookies look delicious!

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:00.150
Yeah, huh?

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:02.160
It's already so late.

00:01:03.890 --> 00:01:06.040
Oh no, I have to go.

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:07.460
Here Kana.

00:01:10.190 --> 00:01:12.950
But what am I supposed to do with these?

00:01:12.950 --> 00:01:15.120
Give them to Yuuki!

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:17.810
Bye!

00:01:22.110 --> 00:01:25.060
Where are you going?

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:33.070
I have one more favor to ask of you.

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:34.450
Can you tell Yuuki that...

00:01:36.090 --> 00:01:37.790
Tell her what?!

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:44.480
Tell her to stay on top of things even without me!

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:52.190
Grandma.

00:01:52.190 --> 00:01:54.550
Yume-san left like the wind,

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:58.510
leaving only the scent of cookies in her wake.

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:36.860
My First Feelings

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:43.570
Kana, I'm just taking out the garbage.

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:45.520
Chief!

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:47.950
Yume-san just got into this enormous car and...

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:49.870
Huh? She left already?

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:52.140
What do you mean by that?

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:53.600
What do you think I mean by it?

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:55.110
You saw it yourself, didn't you?

00:03:57.050 --> 00:03:58.500
Jeez!

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:02.630
I told you to keep your eyes on the road.

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:04.620
But...

00:04:05.110 --> 00:04:07.320
there were all these girls so early in the morning...

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:13.060
and they were of the rare excursion variety!

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:18.300
I'm sorry to butt right in, but...

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:18.960
What's up?

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:21.770
It's just that, not long ago,

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:25.280
Yume-san got into this huge, sparkly, unknown car and then she

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:28.170
was gone, whoosh! Like the wind!

00:04:28.420 --> 00:04:31.400
Oh yeah, today was the day, huh?

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.420
It completely slipped my mind.

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:37.290
What, exactly, was today?

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:40.190
Yume went home.

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:41.830
...Home?

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:45.720
You didn't know about it, did you, Kana?

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:47.960
But why did she go?

00:04:47.960 --> 00:04:49.230
Because she had to.

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:54.600
Yume comes from a noble, old family and she's the heiress!

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:58.530
They kept bothering her to go back and in the end, she just had to.

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:01.560
Noble, old family

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:00.480
A noble old family?

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:03.800
And she's the heiress?

00:05:03.800 --> 00:05:07.080
So her going back by car means that...

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:11.410
<b>She was forced to go back?!</b>

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:11.400
she was forced to go back?!

00:05:11.730 --> 00:05:14.720
Yume left, didn't she?

00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:15.800
Yuuki-san!

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:17.860
Well, you see, that is...

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:19.030
You're back!

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:29.420
This must be quite hard for her.

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:31.010
What are we going to do?!

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:35.350
I don't know if there's anything we can do.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:38.870
I mean this is a trial, forcing Yuuki to finally grow up!

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:40.310
But that's so cruel!

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:42.430
It is hard, though.

00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:45.050
Being alone.

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:52.030
So, Kana-chan!

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:55.700
Don't hold back! Come, fly straight to my bosom!

00:05:57.180 --> 00:06:01.830
Jeez, it's always the same thing with you.

00:06:03.310 --> 00:06:04.990
My name is Kaniko Echizen.

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:09.590
Mmm, that's it.

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:12.120
Is breakfast done?

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:13.660
Yes!

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:14.930
Thank you!

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:18.650
Why don't I go call Yume-san and Yuuki-san?

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:21.180
Yume's not here.

00:06:22.430 --> 00:06:24.690
Oh yeah.

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:31.910
Uhm, Yuuki-san... Breakfast is ready.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:41.000
Yuuki-san is crying!

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:43.430
What should I do, what should I do?

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:47.610
Hinata-san said that this was a trial for her to finally become an adult, but still!

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:51.320
It's so hard when the person you love suddenly disappears!

00:06:51.320 --> 00:06:54.960
Yuuki-san needs Yume-san to be around!

00:06:55.410 --> 00:07:01.720
Tell her to stay on top of things even without me!

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:09.620
Could that possibly have been Yume-san's last words to Yuuki-san?!

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:12.750
What the heck are you doing up here, all by yourself?

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:15.170
Ch-Chief!

00:07:15.170 --> 00:07:17.380
How long have you been standing there?

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:23.190
I got sick of waiting around for you to get breakfast done.

00:07:24.850 --> 00:07:27.070
But Yume-san made those cookies for...!

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:29.140
What are these? They aren't very sweet at all.

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:30.870
Really?

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:36.500
They're salty.

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:41.080
These little crystals aren't sugar; they're salt.

00:07:41.860 --> 00:07:43.700
Could this possibly be...

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:50.030
This is too cruel, Yumeo-san!

00:07:50.310 --> 00:07:53.410
The flower meaning of salty cookies is "Goodbye forever".

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:55.430
You're throwing me away!

00:07:55.430 --> 00:07:57.200
Shut it!

00:07:57.200 --> 00:08:01.660
Our sweet life of leisure is over, baby!

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:03.260
How could you?

00:08:03.260 --> 00:08:06.060
Don't leave me, Yumeo-san!

00:08:06.060 --> 00:08:08.490
Let go of me; get off me!

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:10.420
I'm tired of you!

00:08:11.660 --> 00:08:16.600
Maybe Yume-san didn't get called back by her family after all.

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:18.260
Maybe this is a cataclysmic separation?!

00:08:22.490 --> 00:08:27.200
Uhm, Yume-san told me to give these to you,

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:32.230
but I think she accidentally mixed up the sugar with the salt.

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:35.740
Thank you.

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:46.840
The flower meaning of salty cookies is "Goodbye forever".

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:48.120
What are you talking about?!

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:50.100
What are we going to do, Chief?

00:08:50.100 --> 00:08:52.690
We can only leave her alone.

00:08:52.690 --> 00:08:54.090
But that's terrible!

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:55.260
<b>And...</b>

00:09:07.460 --> 00:09:09.580
I wasn't staring at you, I swear!

00:09:17.310 --> 00:09:19.180
How could this happen?

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:22.790
Yume-san and Yuuki-san were so close!

00:09:28.030 --> 00:09:30.740
No, no, no, that's not what I meant!

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:35.290
I can't tell her to just get along without her!

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:37.130
Kana-chan, are you all right?

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:38.390
Oh, yes!

00:09:40.110 --> 00:09:43.060
It feels kind of strange, having one person missing.

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:47.680
Anybody, more miso-soup?!

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:49.900
Oh no!

00:09:50.090 --> 00:09:51.480
Someone, bring a towel...

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:53.480
I'll do it!

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:57.280
This is something Yume would do...

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:58.560
A mosquito!

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:03.000
All right, you're safe!

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:04.360
Thank you, Kana-chan.

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:05.810
What is that all about?

00:10:05.810 --> 00:10:07.180
Who knows?

00:10:07.180 --> 00:10:09.090
TV, anyone?

00:10:09.090 --> 00:10:10.040
Sure.

00:10:10.820 --> 00:10:16.200
Our next story features the divorce of the couple they used to call the lovebirds...

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:17.490
Morning Scoop
That Wonderful Couple Getting a Divorce?!

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:17.840
It seems they have finally come to an agreement.

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:20.400
Why did you turn it off?

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:25.200
Well, there's this show that I really wanted to see...

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:27.620
All right. Why don't you change the channel then?

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:28.550
Okay.

00:10:28.550 --> 00:10:34.180
Uhm... well... huh... Looks like the remote isn't working!

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:37.320
I'll just turn the TV on directly then.

00:10:39.270 --> 00:10:40.860
Haruka-san!

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:44.970
You don't need to do that.

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:47.240
Kana-chan?

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:50.210
It's fine.

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:54.810
I'm so glad you're finally accepting me!

00:10:56.210 --> 00:10:58.870
That's not what I meant!

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:06.810
Yume-san left her syrup here!

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:09.930
Let's do something even more fun, Haruka-san!

00:11:09.930 --> 00:11:11.830
Let's dance!

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:16.900
La la la! La la la!

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:18.390
Thank you for the meal.

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:22.530
I'm sorry that I couldn't finish it all.

00:11:28.710 --> 00:11:31.490
Yuuki really isn't taking this well.

00:11:32.700 --> 00:11:35.450
It's all my fault.

00:11:35.450 --> 00:11:37.680
There's nothing you can do about it!

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:41.720
But why don't we clean your clothes before the stain sticks?

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:42.700
Huh?

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:44.850
Why don't I help you?

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:47.220
Wait! Why are you touching me there?

00:11:48.510 --> 00:11:50.680
I don't think that's going to come out.

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:53.920
Yeah. Today's miso soup did have oil in it...

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:22.330
I can't let myself feel lonely now.

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:24.790
The person feeling the loneliest is Yuuki-san.

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:28.040
I'm not alone anymore!

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:49.540
Did you like the food, Bunta?

00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:14.140
Or will there be a time when I'm alone again, Grandma?

00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:22.790
Kana, the kettle's boiling.

00:13:23.640 --> 00:13:25.800
I'm sorry!

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:29.760
Entering accounting data hurts my eyes...

00:13:31.270 --> 00:13:32.960
Is it this late already?

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:34.780
What do you want to do for lunch?

00:13:34.780 --> 00:13:38.450
Well, since both Haruka-san and Hinata-san are gone at school today,

00:13:38.450 --> 00:13:41.800
I thought I could maybe make some fried rice out of the leftovers.

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:42.580
Sure.

00:13:42.580 --> 00:13:45.920
I'll be doing the books until then.

00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:49.710
What about Yuuki's lunch?

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:50.870
Should I ask her if she wants to eat?

00:13:50.870 --> 00:13:52.840
Why don't you leave her alone?

00:13:52.840 --> 00:13:54.710
She brought this on herself anyway.

00:13:56.990 --> 00:13:58.420
Oh. All right.

00:14:15.590 --> 00:14:19.560
I guess they're all used to people leaving, by now.

00:14:24.940 --> 00:14:29.470
I wonder if I won't feel lonely anymore either if I get used to it, too.

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:52.800
Don't go!

00:14:53.670 --> 00:14:55.610
Don't go, Yoshikazu-san!

00:14:55.940 --> 00:14:59.290
Why do we have to end this suddenly?

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:01.690
I can't stand this any longer!

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:02.910
I...

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:09.960
I don't want to feel like this lonely anymore! I would rather...

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:12.760
Die.

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:14.550
No, that can't happen!

00:15:14.550 --> 00:15:16.910
You don't have to be that lonely!

00:15:16.910 --> 00:15:18.120
I'm sorry!

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:20.400
It's all my fault!

00:15:20.400 --> 00:15:21.970
What are you doing, Kana?

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:26.950
The TV was acting a little funny, that's all.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.830
Huh? Yuuki-san?

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:37.830
Where are you going, Yuuki-san?

00:15:38.640 --> 00:15:40.670
I can't stand this any longer!

00:15:41.680 --> 00:15:45.540
I don't want to feel like this anymore! I would rather...

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:47.640
Die.

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:50.750
No, you can't go!

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:52.900
No! I have to!

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:54.050
You can't go!

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:57.170
No matter how bad it gets, it's not worth killing yourself over!

00:15:57.170 --> 00:16:02.150
Yume-san herself said that you should try to get along without her!

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:08.010
I'll die, at this rate. I can't take the pain anymore.

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:11.470
Pain, you say?

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:15.000
That's what Yume and I kept trying to tell you!

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:16.810
You need to go to the dentist!

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:21.790
<b>And...</b>

00:16:28.280 --> 00:16:31.680
NOOOOOOO!

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:33.230
I'm not eating, 'cause it makes me sleepy.

00:16:33.230 --> 00:16:38.970
So you went home to attend a memorial service?

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:39.820
That's right.

00:16:39.820 --> 00:16:43.880
I wanted to go with Yuuki, but, well...

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:46.770
Well, maybe it's for the best that she didn't go with you.

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:49.520
Her face totally swelled up from that cavity.

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:52.000
I don't want to be alone anymore.

00:16:55.870 --> 00:16:57.830
I'm home!

00:16:58.060 --> 00:16:59.460
Welcome back!

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:03.020
Hey, let's all light these together!

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:06.830
<b>Fireworks</b>

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:04.740
Oooh, fireworks!

00:17:04.740 --> 00:17:06.830
I won these this afternoon!

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:10.430
Weren't you supposed to be at your exam prep class today?

00:17:10.430 --> 00:17:13.730
Well, it was really more like a prep for the exam prep...

00:17:13.730 --> 00:17:15.170
a warm-up, so to speak.

00:17:15.170 --> 00:17:17.590
I guess you can kiss this year good-bye, too.

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:20.230
Hey, I still have half a year left!

00:17:29.780 --> 00:17:32.290
You really like those, huh?

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:34.540
Yeah, these things are really cool!

00:17:34.540 --> 00:17:39.230
And these snake ones are the second best!

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:47.670
Look, falling stars! Falling stars!

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:51.080
Don't you want to light some fireworks, Kana?

00:17:51.080 --> 00:17:53.970
I'm not really good with flashy things.

00:17:53.970 --> 00:17:56.180
I think I'm better off just watching.

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:03.800
Why don't you stick to these then?

00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:06.350
Oh, a sparkler.

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:11.640
Aren't they nice?

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:12.820
Yeah!

00:19:11.480 --> 00:19:14.430
I can't see the sun today.

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:22.160
Oh, if it isn't Kana!

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:26.100
Mika-chan.

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:27.990
What are you doing here, anyway?

00:19:27.990 --> 00:19:29.870
Are you slacking off?

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:34.340
No, I was just taking a little break.

00:19:34.600 --> 00:19:36.590
For some reason I got tired.

00:19:36.590 --> 00:19:39.730
Well, I'm not! I'm full of life!

00:19:39.730 --> 00:19:42.060
Those who don't work, don't get food, you know!

00:19:44.520 --> 00:19:47.530
Do you want to take a little break?

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:55.190
Hmm, which one should I get?

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:03.000
Would you rather have corn soup or sweet red-bean soup?

00:20:03.880 --> 00:20:07.630
I'm pretty hungry myself, so maybe we could split one?

00:20:09.940 --> 00:20:13.480
Well, if you absolutely insist!

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:16.330
Be glad, I'll help you drink it;

00:20:16.330 --> 00:20:18.220
you can be sure of that!

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:21.870
So do you want corn soup or sweet red-bean soup?

00:20:22.090 --> 00:20:23.560
Whichever you want.

00:20:23.560 --> 00:20:27.550
I'm not selfish or pushy like that.

00:20:31.550 --> 00:20:35.990
Oh, I've been curious about this one, too.

00:20:36.020 --> 00:20:37.440
Oden soup

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:39.550
Here you go!

00:20:40.540 --> 00:20:42.370
You should drink some first.

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:44.830
No, why don't you have some first?

00:20:44.830 --> 00:20:47.380
You bought it, so why don't you drink some first?

00:20:47.380 --> 00:20:49.650
No really, you should have some first...

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:06.610
Fine then. Why don't I buy you one.

00:21:07.140 --> 00:21:08.270
Mika-chan.

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:13.250
Congratulations! You are the winner!

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:15.290
You get another can, free of charge!

00:21:21.140 --> 00:21:24.090
Fun things happen when you're around, Kana!

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:27.770
Huh? You really think so?

00:21:38.160 --> 00:21:41.110
It looks like we're going to have another beautiful day!

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:41.950
Yeah!

00:21:42.340 --> 00:21:45.460
Grandma, I'm alone.

00:21:45.460 --> 00:21:48.660
But I'm also with everyone.

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:54.450
I don't know if this makes me feel lonely or happy...

00:21:54.780 --> 00:21:59.330
Anyway, I'm feeling good again today!

00:23:29.880 --> 00:23:44.900
My First Time Nursing!

00:23:30.670 --> 00:23:32.460
Next time, My First Time Nursing!

00:23:32.460 --> 00:23:35.690
Doesn't the word "nursing" totally remind you of canned peaches?

00:23:33.220 --> 00:23:35.700
G, G. Hey!

00:23:35.690 --> 00:23:37.760
I really want some right now.

00:23:36.970 --> 00:23:39.220
Hey, Haruka.

00:23:37.760 --> 00:23:39.940
Some fresh and juicy peaches!

00:23:39.650 --> 00:23:43.430
Hey, don't we normally do our word-game now?

00:23:39.940 --> 00:23:44.900
All fresh and juicy, in their canned juice!

00:23:43.430 --> 00:23:44.890
Hey!
